# Bind the Assay-backed external intelligence. The kernel sees only an
# Intelligence; the bridge lives at intelligence/assay/bridge.cjs and needs a
# model configured (~/.assay/config.json or AIOS_MODEL_* env). Without one the
# bind succeeds (the bridge answers hello) and the cycle fails with the reason.
entity create thinker => t
cap grant $t kernel * schedule
cap grant $t compute * execute
state create $t context "You are the first entity of a new operating system. State what you now hold to be true."
mind bind $t extern node ../intelligence/assay/bridge.cjs
mind cycle $t
